# Shell scripts run inside Linux containers must keep LF line endings, even on a
# Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true. A CRLF entrypoint fails with
# "set: Illegal option -" (HV-EXP-173). Scoped to *.sh on purpose: some *.py and
# Dockerfile blobs are stored with CRLF, and a wider rule marks them all modified.
*.sh text eol=lf
